{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2080", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2080/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2080/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2080/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2080", "id": 1753543701, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5ohPQV", "number": 2080, "title": "Mavsdk::remove_connection does not remove system", "user": {"login": "jperez-droneup", "id": 111766533, "node_id": "U_kgDOBqlsBQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111766533?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup", "html_url": "https://github.com/jperez-droneup", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jperez-droneup/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2023-06-12T20:37:37Z", "updated_at": "2023-06-13T05:17:47Z", "closed_at": "2023-06-13T05:17:47Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I believe there are still some subscriptions on the MAVSDK side for the removed connection. When removing and re-adding a connection, I get multiple printouts of messages (see heartbeat, MAVLink: info:, and Received ack messages in attached log).\r\n\r\nIt looks like the connection is removed, but the system itself is not. So when we reconnect we get duplicate messages.\r\n\r\nAt this point, I am not subscribed to anything but `subscribe_is_connected` (which is unsubscribed when a disconnect happens) and `subscribe_on_new_system` (which is unsubscribed when the connection is made). Unsubscribing everything on my end does not fix the multiple messages. For example, the only time I see `_heartbeat_timeout_cookie` (\"heartbeats timed out\" message) unsubscribed is when the `SystemImpl` is destructed, but `_systems` in `MavskImpl` is only cleared on destruction and I don't see any way to remove the system after removing the connection.\r\n\r\nI found that the system id of my first system is changed to 1 in [this line](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/ed7ac0777f97a84531c1790cbbc2b0de0438225b/src/mavsdk/core/mavsdk_impl.cpp#L356). However, subsequent connections (after disconnect of initial one and removal of connection) create systems with ID zero and are not changed to 1 because the systems list is not empty. Seems like we need to properly remove the systems - and all internal subscriptions to them - in order for it to properly remove and add a new remote system and have it work correctly.", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.co